### Markdown notes — keep new scratch docs out of the repo ###
# Ignores any NEW .md at the repo root or anywhere under frontend/.
# Files already committed are unaffected: .gitignore never untracks something
# git is already following, so every doc listed below stays versioned. The
# negations are here so that intent is explicit rather than incidental.
# To commit a genuinely new doc anyway: git add -f <file>
/*.md
/frontend/**/*.md
!/README.md
!/CONTEXT.md
!/PROGRESS.md
!/PERFORMANCE.md
!/TASKS.md
!/instructions.md
!/PHASE1A_ADJUSTMENTS_AND_FIXES.md
!/frontend/README.md
!/frontend/ARCHITECTURE.md
!/frontend/DESIGN.md
